    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2df2deb2c7133b9a8377d7b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "好了，来跑步来跑步！哈哈哈，这下子真不知道谁是训练员哩。\n不过，这感觉也不差啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "893790123997b396ea7b979a02ecd453475a4f7112c4ed80d532f715767a6d63",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1012/storytimeline_041012005.json",
      "json_path": [
