      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "菱亚马逊不懂得如何配合对方的步伐与速度。\n即使如此……我们还是迈出脚步，开始了第一次的两人三脚。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5bd0f8cd377203d450e4d3ce24fbaaf782ad5eb10a69b8711091c4f81c3be23",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
